"less a small drop from gravity, \\(\\tfrac12 g(t_1 + t_2)^2\\). A drop of diameter \\(d\\) has \\(m = \\rho\\pi d^3/6\\). The height is proportional to \\(q\\) and to \\(V\\), and to \\(1/v^2\\). Here \\(L = 10.0\\) mm, \\(d_{\\text{gap}} = 2.0\\) mm and \\(D = 15.0\\) mm.",
